OL,3,AHelicopter crashes at Mount Ololokwe in
OL,4,AKenya, killing six people
OL,5,
OL,6,FA helicopter has crashed in central
OL,7,FKenya at Mount Ololokwe in Samburu
OL,8,Fcounty, killing all six people on
OL,9,Fboard, air accident officials have told
OL,10,Fthe BBC.
OL,12,FThe Aircraft Accident Investigation
OL,13,FDepartment said the identities of those
OL,14,Fon board were yet to be confirmed.
OL,15,FLocal media is reporting that the
OL,16,Fhelicopter was carrying tourists.
OL,18,FThe Kenya Civil Aviation Authority
OL,19,F(KCAA) said the accident happened at
OL,20,Fapproximately 09:13 local time (06:13
OL,21,FGMT).
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
