OL,3,AHelicopter crashes at Mount Ololokwe in
OL,4,AKenya, killing six people
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the helicopter was on a scenic
OL,7,Fflight from a wildlife conservancy in
OL,8,FLosaiba to Ewaso Nyiro, a river that
OL,9,Fflows along several national reserves.
